DEPARTMENTAL UNDERTAKING
This is the oldest and traditional form of public enterprises.
The departmental undertaking is considered as one of the departments of government. it
has no separate existence other than government. It is managed by government officials
as one of the government departments. It is under the control of concerned Minister of the
department, who is answerable to government through parliament. For example,
